# Regenerable, and too large for the repository:
#   index.sqlite (~128 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit) is rebuilt by `python tools/library.py index`.
#   ocr-cache/ (~209 MB) holds archive.org page images, per-page OCR and Tesseract language models,
#   used only to produce library/texts/ files (see tools/ocr_archive.py); the texts themselves are kept.
library/index.sqlite
library/ocr-cache/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
